<div class="we-customer-review__header we-customer-review__header--user">
  <span dir="ltr" id="ember10319292" class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line ember-view we-customer-review__user">  Malekhi Scrane
</span>

  <span class="we-customer-review__separator">, </span>

  <time data-test-customer-review-date datetime="2019-06-07T07:00:24.000Z" aria-label="7 June 2019" class="we-customer-review__date" >07/06/2019</time>
</div>

<h3 dir="ltr" id="we-customer-review-41262" class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line ember-view we-customer-review__title">  Jayce Savage
</h3>

  <blockquote id="ember10319293" class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive ember-view we-customer-review__body">      

      <p dir=false data-test-bidi>OK so I love the idea of texting or calling with multiple friends but the thing that is not necessary is that it is way too difficult to use I’ve tried a lot of different ways and it took me almost 100 times to find out how it works and I barely still not know how it works so can you please fix it? —BTW I just read through the texts and I just want to edit this as somebody who is talking about their grandfather dying and that house party save them I love that story but your response was that so heartwarming I love the first part where you said it was heartwarming but then after you said how do we get it to five stars I find this very rude very rude please do not do that!?? P.S. I gave this app 4 stars but because of your response in such a rude way I gave it 2 stars instead! ??</p>

  


<!----></blockquote>

<!----></div>
              
</div>
          
    
              <div id="ember10319297" class="ember-view small-valign-top l-column--equal-height l-column small-4 medium-6 large-4"><div data-test-we-modal="page-overlay" id="ember10319298" class="ember-view"><!---->
<!----></div>


                <div aria-labelledby="we-customer-review-41263" id="ember10319299" class="we-customer-review lockup ember-view"><figure aria-label="5 out of 5" id="ember10319300" class="we-star-rating ember-view we-customer-review__rating we-star-rating--large"><span class="we-star-rating-stars-outlines">
  <span class="we-star-rating-stars we-star-rating-stars-5"></span>
</span>
<!----></figure>

<div class="we-customer-review__header we-customer-review__header--user">
  <span dir="ltr" id="ember10319301" class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line ember-view we-customer-review__user">  Cordin Meikle
</span>

  <span class="we-customer-review__separator">, </span>

  <time data-test-customer-review-date datetime="2019-06-07T09:25:34.000Z" aria-label="7 June 2019" class="we-customer-review__date" >07/06/2019</time>
</div>

<h3 dir="ltr" id="we-customer-review-41263" class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line ember-view we-customer-review__title">  Refreshing change!
</h3>

  <blockquote id="ember10319302" class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive ember-view we-customer-review__body">      

      <p dir=false data-test-bidi>The app was amazing when first download and updated multiple times, but it keeps kicking me and the people I talk to out of the entire app, it freezes, it lags a lot and it’s not the internet provider, because that has been checked by all the parties, if the phone it’s connected to chromecast, the app goes mute, if I leave the app to go to another app it doesn’t say “Paused”, it usually goes black or says “Low Connection. It kills the battery on the phone very rapidly, when using ghost mode on anyone like setting shows you, it still show others that you’re on, and I realized it when ai tested it with friends. The app needs to be updated, because it’s an amazing app to use with multiple people at the same time, and the ringtones are very catchy.</p>

  


<!----></blockquote>

<!----></div>
              
</div>
          

      </div>

